.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt DRM-TOOLS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm drm-tools
.Nd inspect and exercise DRM devices
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The libdrm-tests package installs
.Nm modetest ,
.Nm modeprint ,
.Nm proptest ,
.Nm drmdevice ,
.Nm vbltest
and
.Nm amdgpu_stress .
.Nm modetest
lists connectors, modes, planes and properties and can set modes.
.Nm drmdevice
lists DRM devices.
The tools require access to the device nodes and, for display changes, DRM master.
Choose devices by driver identity rather than a fixed card number.
